<Placemark><name>VIP Diving</name><description>Dive shop. About $205 for 6 days of unlimited shore diving.
Source: OSM way 352388464; matches bonaire.com 12.13941,-68.27554
https://www.vipdiving.com/air-packages</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.27554,12.13941,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Dive Friends @ Yellow Submarine</name><description>Dive Friends&#x27; main Kralendijk shop. 6 days of shore diving $234, gear $57/day. Yellow Sub site out front.
Source: OSM way 366235496; matches bonaire.com 12.16032,-68.28187
https://www.divefriendsbonaire.com/price-list</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.28187,12.1603,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
