Source: OSM way 1500257649; matches bonaire.com 12.14520,-68.26883
https://www.ab-dive.com/</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.26883,12.1452,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Chogogo Dive &amp; Beach Resort</name><description>Best stay for EV charging: public Type 2 charger next door at Isidel Beach Park. A US Tesla needs a Type 2 adapter.
Source: bonaire.com 12.16658,-68.28578; matches OSM way 1085565450</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.28578,12.16658,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Isidel Beach Park (EV charger area)</name><description>Public Type 2 EV charger reported here. Pin is the park, not the exact pole.
Source: OSM park way 1375624159 (charger pole itself not mapped)</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.2866,12.16733,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Flamingo Airport (BON)</name><description>Bonaire International Airport terminal.
Source: OSM terminal node 278302307 (IATA BON)</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.27687,12.13327,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Fundashon Mariadal Hospital + Recompression Chamber</name><description>Kaya Soeur Bartola 2, Kralendijk. Hospital +599 715 8900. Recompression (decompression) chamber is here.
Source: OSM way 366767483 (tagged decompression chamber); matches bonaire.com 12.15400,-68.27502</description><styleUrl>#services</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.2747,12.15384,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Food: cheap/local</name>
<Placemark><name>Maiky Snack</name><description>Rating: 4.4/5 from 202 reviews | Verdict: Good (Locals&#x27; favorite goat stew; very limited hours)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.5 (163) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/maiky-snack/
  TripAdvisor: 4.2 (39), #83 of 169 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d4046608-Reviews.html
Reviews: Reviewers love the authentic goat stew and local vibe at fair prices; the main gripes are the short weekend-only hours and that dishes sell out. A few older TripAdvisor reviews found the stew gristly.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Local goat/beef stobá. Fri–Sun ~11:00–15:00 only, cash preferred; goat can sell out by ~2 PM.
Source: OSM node 2936588678 (Kaminda Nieuw Amsterdam 30, off Kaminda Sorobon); matches bonaire.com 12.14035,-68.24444</description><styleUrl>#food_cheap</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.24464,12.14045,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Cactus Blue food truck</name><description>Rating: 4.7/5 from 1,643 reviews | Verdict: Must try (Top-rated; famous lionfish burger)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.9 (367) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/cactus-blue-foodtruck-bonaire/
  TripAdvisor: 4.6 (1,276), #1 of 12 quick bites in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d1166038-Reviews.html
Reviews: Repeatedly called the best burgers on the island, especially the lionfish burger, with very friendly owners and fresh juices; the only common complaint is price (~$26 for a lionfish burger).
Note: Hours differ by source: bonaire.com shows Tue–Thu 11–15 only, vs Mon–Fri elsewhere. Check before driving.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Burgers, wraps, lionfish burgers (they sell out). Mon–Fri 11:00–15:00. At Donkey Beach / dive site #37 Corporal Meiss, start of the runway.
Source: OSM node 5196524223; matches bonaire.com 12.13085,-68.28423
https://www.cactusblue.us/location/</description><styleUrl>#food_cheap</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.28437,12.13054,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Posada Para Mira</name><description>Rating: 4.5/5 from 991 reviews | Verdict: Must try (Best-reviewed local Krioyo food + views)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.5 (630) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/posada-para-mira/
  TripAdvisor: 4.4 (361), #1 of 6 restaurants in Rincon https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g8655349-d4056219-Reviews.html
Reviews: Praised for goat and beef stew, iguana soup, conch and fresh fish in a garden setting with hill views and friendly service; the main knock is that it isn&#x27;t cheap.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Rincon local stews $18–21, veggie plate $20. Hours conflict between sources, call ahead.
Source: OSM way 372101986; matches bonaire.com 12.23656,-68.33946
https://www.posadaparamira.com/menus?menu=food</description><styleUrl>#food_cheap</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.33946,12.23652,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Rose Inn / Kos Bon So</name><description>Rating: 4.5/5 from 428 reviews | Verdict: Good (Cheap, generous local plates in Rincon)
  Google (Rose Inn) via bonaire.com: 4.5 (93) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/rose-inn/
  Google (Kos Bon So) via bonaire.com: 4.5 (311) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/kos-bon-so/
  TripAdvisor (Kos Bon So): 4.8 (24), #2 of 6 restaurants in Rincon https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g8655349-d25407163-Reviews.html
Reviews: Two neighbouring local spots: Kos Bon So is liked for ribs, grilled chicken, conch and cold cheap beer with big portions; Rose Inn for goat/beef stew and personal service. Downsides: disposable plates and some waits.
Note: This pin combines two separate places; ratings are listed per place.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Rincon local stews and fish, Kaya Guyaba. Hours conflict between sources, call ahead.
Source: OSM way 371773495 (Kos Bon So, Kaya Guyaba); bonaire.com Rose Inn 12.23731,-68.32980 and Kos Bon So 12.23751,-68.32981</description><styleUrl>#food_cheap</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.32983,12.23748,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Nadia Snack Bar</name><description>Rating: 4.4/5 from 90 reviews | Verdict: OK (Decent rating but few recent reviews)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.4 (90) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/nadia-snack-bar-restaurant/
Reviews: Reviewers like the cheap, hot, fresh Chinese-style local dishes and take-away (e.g. sweet-and-sour shrimp) and the friendly owner. Little to go on: the newest reviews shown are from early 2025.
Note: No recent (2025–26) reviews found, so current quality is unverified.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Local meals ~$8–12 (price unverified). Kaya Andres A. Emerenciana 6.
Source: bonaire.com 12.14498,-68.26521; matches Google plus code 4PVM+XWV (TripTap) and address (Waze/FindYello)</description><styleUrl>#food_cheap</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.26521,12.14498,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Panaderia Seruva</name><description>Rating: 4.5/5 from 125 reviews | Verdict: Good (Loved local bakery; go early)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.5 (125) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/panaderia-seruva/
Reviews: Fans like the fresh bread, pastechi and coconut treats and the caring service; the main warning is that items sell out early.
