<Placemark><name>Coffee Stop</name><description>Rating: 4.9/5 from 31 reviews | Verdict: Good (Great coffee &amp; service, few reviews)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.9 (31) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/coffee-stop-bonaire/
Reviews: Recent reviews rave about the coffee and very friendly service close to the cruise terminal. Only ~31 reviews.
Note: One Sept 2026 review calls it &#x27;Dule Coffee Shop&#x27;, so it may have been renamed. Confirm on arrival.
