<Placemark><name>The Dock (Ocean Breeze Marina)</name><description>Rating: 4.5/5 from 392 reviews | Verdict: Good (Solid food, Thursday BBQ)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.5 (392) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/the-dock-bonaire/
Reviews: Recent diners praise the tuna steak, ribs, fresh fish, cocktails and the Thursday BBQ in a small-harbour setting; few complaints in recent reviews.
