<Folder><name>Food: mid-range</name>
<Placemark><name>Blennies (Buddy Dive)</name><description>Rating: 3.8/5 from 516 reviews | Verdict: Skip (Lowest rated; slow, uneven food)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.0 (191) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/blennies-restaurant/
  TripAdvisor: 3.7 (325), #65 of 169 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d7892940-Reviews.html
Reviews: The sunset view and breakfast spot get compliments, but 2026 reviews complain about greasy or lukewarm food, long waits and wrong orders.
Note: Several negative reviews in Aug–Sep 2026.
