<Placemark><name>Rum Runners (Captain Don&#x27;s Habitat)</name><description>Rating: 4.1/5 from 2,907 reviews | Verdict: OK (Great view, inconsistent food)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.1 (891) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/rum-runners/
  TripAdvisor: 4.1 (2,016), #9 of 169 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d1453263-Reviews.html
Reviews: People like the waterfront view and some pizzas; recent reviews are split, with cold or flavorless ribs and unfriendly staff on some nights.
