<Placemark><name>Cuba Compagnie</name><description>Rating: 4.3/5 from 3,166 reviews | Verdict: Good (Fun Thursday salsa night, good value)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.4 (1,428) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/cuba-compagnie/
  TripAdvisor: 4.3 (1,738), #23 of 170 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d6478724-Reviews.html
Reviews: Loved for the lively atmosphere, mojitos, tuna and snapper and the Thursday salsa night; complaints include slow or inattentive service and some salty or bland dishes.
