<Placemark><name>Bon Tapa</name><description>Rating: 4.6/5 from 437 reviews | Verdict: Good (Tasty tapas, a few recent misses)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.7 (287) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/bon-tapa-restaurant-bonaire/
  TripAdvisor: 4.5 (150), #2 of tapas restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurants-g147268-zfd10942-Kralendijk_Bonaire-Tapas.html
Reviews: Most reviewers enjoy the varied tapas (honey chicken, garlic shrimp, short rib) and friendly staff; a few 2026 reviews mention stale bread, flies and weaker value than before.
