https://www.bontapa.com/</description><styleUrl>#food_mid</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.27713,12.151,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Sebastian&#x27;s</name><description>Rating: 4.0/5 from 2,777 reviews | Verdict: OK (Go for the sunset pier, not the food)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.1 (1,219) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/sebastian-s-restaurant-bar-lounge/
  TripAdvisor: 4.0 (1,558), #48 of 169 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d5490282-Reviews.html
Reviews: The pier sunset setting is the star; food reviews are average and service is often called slow, with high prices.
Ratings fetched Oct 9, 2026
Waterfront, mains ~$28–40. Sunday Italian night, Wednesday 4-course $39. Reserve a pier table for sunset.
Source: OSM node 1277196793; matches bonaire.com 12.14034,-68.27579
https://sebastiansrestaurantbonaire.com/</description><styleUrl>#food_mid</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-68.27584,12.14062,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mezze</name><description>Rating: 4.6/5 from 1,380 reviews | Verdict: Good (High ratings, but ownership change)
  Google via bonaire.com: 4.6 (492) https://bonaire.com/en/restaurants/mezze-restaurant/
  TripAdvisor: 4.6 (888), #12 of 170 restaurants in Kralendijk https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g147268-d10836060-Reviews.html
Reviews: Recent Google reviews praise the hummus, octopus, ribeye, halal and vegan options and a welcoming owner; several TripAdvisor regulars say quality dropped after the restaurant was sold (slower service, smaller menu, higher prices).
Note: Reported sale/ownership change; older ratings may not reflect the current kitchen.
